{"step_index":70,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-27T13:11:28Z","model":"gemini-4-hydrogen-high","input_tokens":2703,"cache_read_tokens":93781,"output_tokens":1046,"content":"Updated the theme, logo, header, and footer across all pages to match your screenshots:\n\n### What Was Changed\n- **Dark Luxury Theme ([css/common.css](file:///C:/Users/User/OneDrive/Desktop/CarVault%20project/css/common.css), [css/pages.css](file:///C:/Users/User/OneDrive/Desktop/CarVault%20project/css/pages.css))**:\n  - Switched from the light/navy theme to the obsidian charcoal palette (`#141414` background with subtle top gradient, `#1B1B1B` elevated surfaces, `#222222` secondary controls, subtle `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09)` hairline borders, and `#EAB308` gold accents).\n  - Updated typography across [index.html](file:///C:/Users/User/OneDrive/Desktop/CarVault%20project/index.html), [explore-cars.html](file:///C:/Users/User/OneDrive/Desktop/CarVault%20project/pages/explore-cars.html), and [car-details.html](file:///C:/Users/User/OneDrive/Desktop/CarVault%20project/pages/car-details.html) to load `Plus Jakarta Sans` alongside `DM Sans`, adding the gold `CARVAULT / ...` eyebrow labels and split section headers.\n  - Restyled car cards, filter sidebar, search/sort inputs, car details gallery/specs/estimator, wishlist modal, and 4-state test drive booking modal for the dark theme.\n- **Logo ([images/logo/car-vault-logo.svg](file:///C:/Users/User/OneDrive/Desktop/CarVault%20project/images/logo/car-vault-logo.svg), [js/common.js](file:///C:/Users/User/OneDrive/Desktop/CarVault%20project/js/common.js))**:\n  - Replaced the shield emblem with the `CAR ✦ VAULT` wordmark featuring the 4-pointed gold star (`BRAND_STAR_SVG`) used in both the header and footer, and updated `car-vault-logo.svg` to match.\n- **Header & Top Utility Bar ([js/common.js](file:///C:/Users/User/OneDrive/Desktop/CarVault%20project/js/common.js))**:\n  - Added the centered top bar